OL,3,GNEWSAMen sentenced for attempted #34m
OL,4,Acocaine boat smuggle
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of men who admitted to
OL,7,Fsmuggling almost half a tonne of
OL,8,Fcocaine into an East Sussex harbour on
OL,9,Fa fishing boat have been sent to
OL,10,Fprison.
OL,12,FThe drugs had been deposited in the
OL,13,FEnglish Channel and fitted with a GPS
OL,14,Ftracker so the defendants would know
OL,15,Fwhere in the sea they could be
OL,16,Fretrieved before taking them to
OL,17,FEastbourne's Sovereign Harbour, the
OL,18,Fcourt heard.
OL,20,FThe National Crime Agency (NCA) said it
OL,21,Fhad a street value of #34m.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
